{"sha": "5c94ccdd5197c71ec64a9d38f8102b97e99839a0b39e55b0e8d4f389179708b0", "body": ["\\chapter{分数：四则运算}\\label{ch:g8:fractions}", "", "本章完成分数的全部运算：加法与减法，", "分母可以\\emph{任意}，乘法，以及——", "新来的——除法，其实是一种伪装的乘法。", "来自\\cref{ch:g8:negprod}的符号法则也一并适用。", "", "\\section{分母任意的加法}", "", "\\begin{method}[通分]\\label{met:g8:fractions:add}", "对 $\\frac ab$ 与 $\\frac cd$ 做加法或减法：", "\\begin{enumerate}", "  \\item 求 $b$ 与 $d$ 的一个公倍数（积", "        $b \\times d$ 总是可行；取较小的公倍数可以省些功夫）；", "  \\item 把两个分数都化为以该公倍数为分母的分数；", "  \\item 对分子做加法或减法，并化简。", "\\end{enumerate}", "\\end{method}", "", "\\begin{example}\\label{ex:g8:fractions:add}", "计算 $\\dfrac{5}{6} + \\dfrac{3}{4}$。$6$ 与", "$4$ 的一个公倍数是 $12$：", "\\[", "\\frac{5}{6} = \\frac{10}{12},", "\\qquad", "\\frac{3}{4} = \\frac{9}{12},", "\\qquad", "\\frac{5}{6} + \\frac{3}{4} = \\frac{10 + 9}{12} = \\frac{19}{12}.", "\\]", "含负号时：$\\dfrac{2}{3} - \\dfrac{7}{5} = \\dfrac{10}{15} -", "\\dfrac{21}{15} = -\\dfrac{11}{15}$。", "\\end{example}", "", "\\section{分数的乘法}", "", "\\begin{theorem}[分数的乘积]\\label{thm:g8:fractions:mult}", "\\[", "\\frac{a}{b} \\times \\frac{c}{d} = \\frac{a \\times c}{b \\times d} .", "\\]", "\\end{theorem}", "", "\\begin{proof}[从图形看原因]", "以 $\\frac34$ 乘正方形的 $\\frac25$：竖切成 $5$ 条，", "保留 $2$ 条；再横切成 $4$ 份，保留剩下部分中的 $3$", "行。保留部分是由 $3 \\times 2$ 个小格组成的方格网，", "它取自 $4 \\times 5$ 个小格，即分数 $\\frac{6}{20}$。", "\\end{proof}", "", "\\begin{omfigure}", "\\begin{tikzpicture}[scale=0.68]", "  \\draw[gray!50, thin] (0,0) grid[xstep=1, ystep=1] (5,4);", "  \\fill[omDef!18] (0,0) rectangle (2,4);", "  \\fill[omThm!35] (0,0) rectangle (2,3);", "  \\draw[thick] (0,0) rectangle (5,4);", "  \\draw[omDef, thick] (2,0) -- (2,4);", "  \\draw[omThm, thick] (0,3) -- (5,3);", "  \\node[below, font=\\small, omDef] at (1,0) {$\\frac25$ 保留};", "  \\node[right, font=\\small, omThm] at (5.05,1.5) {$\\frac34$ 的部分};", "\\end{tikzpicture}", "", "{\\small $\\frac34 \\times \\frac25$：双阴影区域是", "$3 \\times 2 = 6$ 个小格（共 $4 \\times 5 = 20$ 个），即\\", "$\\frac{6}{20} = \\frac{3}{10}$ ——分子相乘，分母", "相乘。}", "\\end{omfigure}", "", "\\begin{example}\\label{ex:g8:fractions:mult}", "约分要\\emph{在相乘之前}进行，划去公因数：", "\\[", "\\frac{7}{12} \\times \\frac{9}{14}", "= \\frac{7 \\times 9}{12 \\times 14}", "= \\frac{7 \\times 3 \\times 3}{3 \\times 4 \\times 2 \\times 7}", "= \\frac{3}{8}", "\\]", "（分子、分母中的因数 $7$ 与一个 $3$ 被约去）。", "含负号时，先由\\cref{thm:g8:negprod:rules}确定符号：", "$\\left(-\\frac23\\right) \\times \\left(-\\frac{5}{4}\\right) =", "+\\frac{10}{12} = \\frac56$。", "\\end{example}", "", "\\section{分数的除法}", "", "\\begin{definition}[倒数]\\label{def:g8:fractions:inverse}", "非零数 $x$ 的\\emph{倒数}\\index{倒数}是", "与 $x$ 相乘得 $1$ 的数。", "$\\frac ab$ 的倒数是 $\\frac ba$，因为", "$\\frac ab \\times \\frac ba = \\frac{ab}{ab} = 1$；整数 $n$ 的倒数是", "$\\frac1n$。", "\\end{definition}", "", "\\begin{theorem}[除法即乘以倒数]\\label{thm:g8:fractions:div}", "设 $c \\neq 0$：", "\\[", "\\frac{a}{b} \\div \\frac{c}{d} = \\frac{a}{b} \\times \\frac{d}{c} .", "\\]", "\\end{theorem}", "", "\\begin{proof}", "由定义，商 $q$ 是 $\\frac ab$ 除以 $\\frac cd$ 所得的数，", "即满足 $q \\times \\frac cd = \\frac ab$ 的数。验证候选值", "$q = \\frac ab \\times \\frac dc$：", "\\[", "\\left(\\frac ab \\times \\frac dc\\right) \\times \\frac cd", "= \\frac ab \\times \\left(\\frac dc \\times \\frac cd\\right)", "= \\frac ab \\times 1 = \\frac ab . \\qedhere", "\\]", "\\end{proof}", "", "\\begin{example}\\label{ex:g8:fractions:div}", "\\[", "\\frac{3}{5} \\div \\frac{7}{10}", "= \\frac{3}{5} \\times \\frac{10}{7}", "= \\frac{3 \\times 10}{5 \\times 7}", "= \\frac{30}{35} = \\frac{6}{7}.", "\\]", "检验一下：除以 $\\frac{7}{10}$（一个小于", "$1$ 的数）的结果必须\\emph{大于} $\\frac35$ ——而且", "事实上 $\\frac67 > \\frac35$（$\\frac{30}{35} > \\frac{21}{35}$）。", "\\end{example}", ""]}